5. Test harness reachability of the registered handler
   src/telegram/goal-commands.test.ts:3094, 3205

       describe("registerTelegramGoalCommands /new_goal", () => {
       ...
       const newGoalHandler = harness.handlers.new_goal;

   Confirms registerTelegramGoalCommands actually exposes a callable
